  "fullDescription": "Introducing School Retro, a captivating Scribble Display font that harmoniously fuses playful and groovy lettering with a nostalgic back-to-school theme. This typeface adds a sprinkle of yesteryears charm to any project, making your design visually stimulating and irresistibly unique. Significant for its retro flair, School Retro embodies quirky individuality while echoing timeless school-day memories. Let every keystroke be a tribute to groovy and immersive learning adventures of the past. Perfect for creating a wide variety of new designs to match products such as banners, content, mugs, cards, shirts, stationery, social media posts, and more!",
